.TH tclppvars n 2.0 Tclpp "Tclpp Built-In Commands"
.BS
.SH NAME
tclppvars \- Variables used by Tclpp
.SH DESCRIPTION
The following global variables are created and managed by the Tclpp library.
All these variables should be treated as read-only by application specific
code and by users.
.TP
\fBtclpp_patchLevel\fR
Returns the current version and patch level information as a string. For 
example, \fB2.0b2\fR represents the second beta release of release 2.0.
.TP
\fBtclpp_version\fR
Return the major and minor release number of the current Tclpp release.
This does not include any patch level information.
.LP
.SH AUTHOR(S)
Stefan Sinnige (ssinnige@geocities.com)
